n>地址（如<span class="_ _7e"> </span><span class="ff10">142.250.190.46<span class="_ _f"></span></span>）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y2f3 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">解析过程<span class="ff4">：</span></div><div class="t m0 x64 h7 y2f4 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">主机</div><div class="t m0 x92 h26 y2f5 ff4 fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">域名</div><div class="t m0 x1c h7 y2f4 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">−<span class="_ _43"></span>−<span class="_ _2e"></span>−<span class="_ _43"></span>→<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff3">DNS<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">服务器</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x65 h26 y2f5 ff3 fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">IP <span class="ff4">地址</span></div><div class="t m0 x32 h7 y2f4 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">−<span class="_ _43"></span>−<span class="_ _2e"></span>−<span class="_ _2e"></span>−<span class="_ _2e"></span>−<span class="_ _43"></span>→<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff4">主机</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y2f6 ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">7.2<span class="_ _24"> </span>DHCP<span class="_ _5"> </span>(<span class="ff1">动态主机配置协议</span>)</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y2f7 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.2.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">基本概念</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h6 y2f8 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">DHCP<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">即<span class="ff1">动态主机配置协议</span>，通常用于局域网中，基于<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>UDP<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">协议工作（服务器端口<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>67<span class="ff4">，客户端端口<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>68<span class="ff4">）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y2f9 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">7.2.2<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">核心功能</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h6 y2fa ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">实现自动从<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>池中获取<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>地址的功能。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y2fb ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">自动化配置<span class="ff4">：新接入网络的主机无需手动设定<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">IP</span>、子网掩码、网关等信息，即插即用。</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y2fc ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">地址复用<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _4"></span><span class="ff3">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">地址由服务器动态分配，<span class="_ _4"></span>主机离线后地址回收到“<span class="ff3">IP<span class="_ _8"> </span></span>池”<span class="_ _3"></span>中，<span class="_ _4"></span>供其他主机使用，<span class="_ _29"></span>有效节约了</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y2fd ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">IP<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">资源。</span></div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">23<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
